      <summary>Gets or sets horizontal alignment of the string.</summary>
      <returns>A <see cref="T:System.Drawing.StringAlignment" /> enumeration that spec+ﬁTπ␀Ä␀Äifies the horizontal  alignment of the string.</returns>
    </member>
