          <see langword="true" /> if the <see cref="T:System.Web.UI.WebControls.WebControl" /> object is enabled; otherwise, <see langword="false" />.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.Web.UI.WebControls.WebControl.SkinID">
